      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Eurostar generally allows you to bring a limited amount of luggage, usually based on size rather than a strict weight limit for standard carry-ons. You can typically bring your own main cabin baggage and a small personal item. For security, it is recommended to arrive at St Pancras well in advance, aiming to be there at least 45-60 minutes before your scheduled departure time. This buffer allows plenty of time for checking in and passing through security.",
      "source": "target",
