    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. what about if i have a bigger suitcase though? i probably can't fit everything in a small personal item. do they actually weigh the bags or do they just look at the size? also just curious about the layout at st pancras... is it pretty straightforward or is it kind of a mess to navigate through the checkpoints?",
